Key Technical Achievements
Automated CI Test Gating: Implemented automated test discovery and execution inside ephemeral Ubuntu runners using pytest. Configured dependency gating (needs: unit-tests) to prevent broken code from proceeding to the build and packaging stage.

Build Time Optimization: Structured the Dockerfile with optimized layer ordering (copying requirements.txt and caching dependency installation before code copying), drastically cutting image rebuild times.

Secure Registry Integration: Configured asymmetric GitHub Actions Repository Secrets (DOCKER_USERNAME, DOCKER_PASSWORD) to enable zero-exposure authentication against Docker Hub using the official docker/login-action.

Multi-Tagging & Traceability: Automated image releases using docker/build-push-action, simultaneously generating a mutable :latest tag for immediate runtime consumption and an immutable :${{ github.sha }} tag for end-to-end auditability and instant rollbacks.

Security & Permission Hardening: Resolved GitHub PAT authorization scopes by enforcing explicit workflow permissions for workflow file modifications.


